<title>RUSSIA: Russian Sept aluminium exports down 14.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Russian Sept aluminium exports down 14.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian exports of aluminium and aluminium alloys in September were 189,850 tonnes, a decrease of 14.5 percent on August's level, State Customs Committee figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The figures, carried by Interfax news agency, comprised 174,300 tonnes of primary aluminium and 15,550 tonnes of aluminium alloys.</p>
<p>Russian exports of aluminium and aluminium alloys over the first nine months of this year were 1.92 million tonnes, an increase of 20.9 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
